# Cells the KLayout standard-cell LVS deck (sky130_stdcell.lvs) cannot pair with
# their CDL subcircuit, kept out of synthesis, sizing and CTS so every design's
# LVS stays a full transistor-level check.
#
# Their layouts draw parallel series chains (e.g. the A1/A2 pull-down of a21oi_2
# as two chains with their own inner nodes) that the CDL writes as one chain with
# m=N; the engine merges parallel devices but not parallel series chains. Each
# was seen failing in a design's LVS: a21oi_2 in gcd, the others in aes
# (2026-10-15); o211ai_4 in aes, chosen by post-route resizing (2026-10-19). Black-boxing them instead would need li1 and well pins in the abstract
# stream.
sky130_fd_sc_hd__a21oi_2
sky130_fd_sc_hd__a2111oi_2
sky130_fd_sc_hd__a211oi_4
sky130_fd_sc_hd__a21boi_2
sky130_fd_sc_hd__a31o_4
sky130_fd_sc_hd__o211a_4
sky130_fd_sc_hd__o211ai_4
